WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
This show contains scenes that some viewers may 
find disturbing. Viewer discretion is advised.

00:01.480 --> 00:04.460
<b>O Prayers, Have You Reached Heaven?</b>

00:09.970 --> 00:10.880
Is it over?

00:10.880 --> 00:12.260
Looks like it.

00:32.070 --> 00:33.260
Thank goodness.

00:42.890 --> 00:45.080
You're all right now.

00:46.200 --> 00:47.290
It's okay.

00:49.780 --> 00:52.510
It appears as though she's calming down.

00:53.170 --> 00:53.490
Yeah.

00:53.810 --> 00:57.400
Things seemed unsure for a little while...

00:57.400 --> 01:01.160
As long as she feels better, 
the reason doesn't matter.

01:01.160 --> 01:05.160
I believe that, if we are asking questions,
 it should be about this.

01:05.160 --> 01:06.140
What do you think?

01:06.140 --> 01:12.270
Well, I'm quite certain that they 
were trying to resurrect a dark god.

01:12.270 --> 01:13.120
Hey.

01:13.610 --> 01:15.340
We're done with work now, right?

01:15.650 --> 01:17.220
We can leave now, right?

01:17.220 --> 01:21.240
No. There are still some 
goblin stragglers up above.

01:21.240 --> 01:22.410
We need to slay all of them.

01:22.410 --> 01:23.440
Yeesh...

01:23.440 --> 01:25.760
It will be a fearsome trip home.

01:25.760 --> 01:27.810
Well, what can ya do?

01:35.400 --> 01:38.030
I just want to hurry home and bathe.

01:38.030 --> 01:40.780
Well, you probably won't have to 
wait long for a rain of blood.

01:48.170 --> 01:48.960
Wha—

01:56.170 --> 02:01.410
A greater demon's hand...

03:45.870 --> 03:50.790
O ye who went beyond the 
white destruction, maniraptor!

03:50.790 --> 03:53.870
Behold my deeds in battle!

04:00.910 --> 04:02.850
I'll use... a miracle...

04:02.850 --> 04:03.740
Nay...

04:03.740 --> 04:10.270
I no longer have any spells I can use.

04:11.480 --> 04:12.570
Scaly!

04:12.570 --> 04:14.600
Hey! This is bad!

04:18.220 --> 04:19.610
You're still alive, aren't you?

04:19.610 --> 04:22.150
Well, I am not dead yet.

04:22.770 --> 04:24.090
Thank you.

04:24.090 --> 04:26.800
It's nothing. Create a wall!

04:26.800 --> 04:28.890
Create a wall?

04:29.880 --> 04:30.950
The snow!

04:31.210 --> 04:33.000
This way! Hurry!

04:33.000 --> 04:33.850
Right!

04:38.250 --> 04:39.920
Orcbolg! Hurry!

04:39.920 --> 04:40.880
Right.

04:42.590 --> 04:48.800
Atali, O Atali. Might you 
grace this hero with a dance?

04:53.730 --> 04:57.190
'Tis a simple snow cave. What do you think?

04:57.710 --> 04:58.970
We might... be okay.

04:58.970 --> 05:02.150
A healing... no. Can I get a stamina potion?

05:02.390 --> 05:03.190
Yeah.

05:04.070 --> 05:06.640
You and that girl have some, too.

05:06.640 --> 05:07.350
Right!

05:09.780 --> 05:12.750
Beard-cutter, long-ears, 
you two have some of this, too.

05:17.940 --> 05:19.670
Drink it. It'll warm you up.

05:19.950 --> 05:21.420
You'll die if you don't move around.

05:21.420 --> 05:22.970
I really hate this stuff.

05:29.800 --> 05:32.260
Looks like that hand won't reach over here.

05:32.670 --> 05:35.520
We achieved our goal, then. 
How's the girl doing?

05:36.170 --> 05:37.820
She's physically weak.

05:38.590 --> 05:41.230
She probably won't last here long.

05:42.220 --> 05:43.400
What do you think?

05:46.280 --> 05:49.990
No... I guess our choices 
are to attack or retreat.

05:52.810 --> 05:55.000
There's no reason why we need to defeat it.

05:55.000 --> 05:59.580
True. If I were to quote you, 
that's clearly not a gob—

06:13.960 --> 06:15.770
I'm... okay...

06:16.210 --> 06:18.810
So that thing can actually move.

06:21.000 --> 06:22.210
Can it see?

06:26.220 --> 06:28.070
What do we do, Beard-cutter?

06:33.860 --> 06:35.290
I have a plan.

06:37.430 --> 06:38.460
Let's do this.

06:39.260 --> 06:40.070
Right!

06:52.490 --> 06:53.550
Over here!

07:00.640 --> 07:02.100
Not happening!

07:07.520 --> 07:11.360
It's called Medea's Oil, or petroleum. 
It's water that burns.

07:15.290 --> 07:17.400
Goblin Slayer, what about the flame?

07:17.400 --> 07:19.310
It's too cold. It won't light.

07:19.310 --> 07:20.850
Get back! Go!

07:20.850 --> 07:21.720
Right!

07:23.250 --> 07:26.340
Never forget this when adventuring... I guess.

07:31.410 --> 07:32.510
Come on!

07:39.450 --> 07:42.950
Goblin Slayer! Goblin Slayer!

07:42.950 --> 07:45.310
I'm... fine.

07:45.980 --> 07:47.270
How's it going with you?

07:47.270 --> 07:48.280
Oh, right!

07:48.280 --> 07:49.860
I'll do it right away!

07:50.540 --> 07:51.520
<i>I knew it.</i>

07:51.520 --> 07:53.930
<i>This was a key for this place.</i>

07:56.130 --> 07:57.290
I'm ready at any time!

07:57.290 --> 07:58.190
I see.

08:05.960 --> 08:06.960
<i>Another blizzard!</i>

08:13.280 --> 08:14.680
Goblin Slayer!

08:16.390 --> 08:17.730
Orcbolg!

08:16.750 --> 08:21.130
Dance, dance, Salamander. 
Lend me some of your tail's flame.

08:23.890 --> 08:26.490
O sickle wings of the velociraptor...

08:26.490 --> 08:29.150
Slice, fly, and hunt!

08:29.150 --> 08:31.860
O ye who brings great destruction!

08:31.860 --> 08:36.500
If you want us as corpses, 
bring forth the fiery stone from heaven!

08:38.970 --> 08:40.490
Go for it, long-ears!

09:09.690 --> 09:11.960
O merciful Earth Mother,

09:11.960 --> 09:16.110
please protect us, the weak, 
with the powers of the earth.

09:33.850 --> 09:35.620
Did we do it?

09:37.720 --> 09:38.840
Not... yet!

09:51.610 --> 09:55.610
<i>Not... yet. No. I'm not done yet! I'm not!</i>

09:55.610 --> 09:56.320
It's coming!

10:04.890 --> 10:08.230
This is an elevator...

10:23.570 --> 10:26.810
A hammer... and an anvil.

10:28.020 --> 10:30.560
That's right. 
I'm impressed you remembered.

10:31.810 --> 10:33.230
That's...

10:33.890 --> 10:38.200
That's because it's something you taught me.

10:39.090 --> 10:39.960
I see.

10:40.610 --> 10:41.450
Yes.

10:57.710 --> 10:59.030
Take that!

11:01.040 --> 11:01.720
That's eight!

11:04.200 --> 11:05.210
That's ten.

11:08.270 --> 11:09.560
How does it look?

11:09.560 --> 11:12.650
Looks clear... Though I'm not 
too confident about that.

11:12.650 --> 11:14.650
I'll go get them, then.

11:17.120 --> 11:18.990
It's all right now.

11:19.350 --> 11:21.450
Hey, thanks.

11:22.300 --> 11:27.020
I'm terribly sorry. If only my body 
were a bit more responsive...

11:27.020 --> 11:30.210
Oh, no. I just wish I were stronger...

11:30.210 --> 11:33.880
You still wouldn't be able 
to carry these two around.

11:33.880 --> 11:34.820
But...

11:34.820 --> 11:40.170
Even if you had some more muscle on ya, 
humans and dwarves are built different.

11:41.830 --> 11:47.360
Thank you... I'm sorry... Thank you...

11:47.870 --> 11:49.310
Big Brother...

11:49.660 --> 11:52.930
<i>I was just like this eighteen months ago.</i>

11:53.770 --> 12:00.230
<i>I didn't know anything... I was innocent, 
I lacked strength, and I was foolish.</i>

12:01.000 --> 12:03.740
<i>She is me.</i>

12:07.310 --> 12:08.600
You can't help what you don't have.

12:09.550 --> 12:12.090
So you just have to make do
 with what you do have.

12:12.090 --> 12:14.570
I think you're trying to tell 
her not to worry about this,

12:14.570 --> 12:16.330
but you really gotta work 
on how you word things.

12:16.540 --> 12:19.590
Are you two all right?

12:19.590 --> 12:21.530
Yeah, I'm fine.

12:21.530 --> 12:22.670
I'm good.

12:22.970 --> 12:23.810
All right.

12:51.470 --> 12:53.390
I mean, we knew this would happen.

12:53.390 --> 12:56.790
We made quite a ruckus with 
that giant hand back there.

12:56.790 --> 12:59.680
Pretty sure they wouldn't have 
noticed us if it weren't for that.

12:59.680 --> 13:01.640
Well, this is definitely backwards.

13:01.640 --> 13:03.510
It feels like we're the ones about to be slain.

13:03.790 --> 13:06.610
A dungeon and a dragon... 
A cave and a troll...

13:06.610 --> 13:08.950
And an abyss and adventurers.

13:10.010 --> 13:11.310
Ah, yes. It all makes sense.

13:11.310 --> 13:12.810
Are you good, Scaly?

13:12.810 --> 13:17.270
'Tis fine. I made up my mind that when I met 
my death, I would be standing upright.

13:17.270 --> 13:21.610
So, do we have a plan, Sir Goblin Slayer?

13:29.160 --> 13:32.430
Goblin Slayer?

13:32.430 --> 13:35.280
This incident won't make the 
kingdom or army take action.

13:35.770 --> 13:38.270
I'm sure the king doesn't 
want the world to know that

13:38.270 --> 13:39.900
a family member was kidnapped by goblins.

13:40.450 --> 13:41.250
Right...

13:47.790 --> 13:50.890
Goblin... Slayer...

13:51.440 --> 13:53.350
This is goblin slaying.

14:03.690 --> 14:06.610
But... if it's not...

14:07.450 --> 14:08.900
Lord of Judgment,

14:08.900 --> 14:13.290
Sword Prince, Bearer of Scales, 
show your power!

14:15.160 --> 14:15.910
Wha—

14:18.210 --> 14:20.150
Well, I'll be damned...

14:20.150 --> 14:23.090
I see... Hammer and anvil indeed.

14:24.090 --> 14:25.080
So this was your plan.

14:26.460 --> 14:29.470
Everyone, your enemies are not the goblins.

14:30.080 --> 14:34.870
They are the non-prayers who wish to bring 
the demons of chaos into our world...

14:34.870 --> 14:36.680
The evil sect.

14:38.340 --> 14:43.060
A certain adventurer informed me of this.

14:43.330 --> 14:47.030
May each and every one of them be struck 
down by the judgment they deserve!

14:47.030 --> 14:48.990
O merciful Earth Mother,

14:47.370 --> 14:50.650
O goddess of battle! Grant us victory!

14:47.510 --> 14:52.650
Watchman of the candle, please shine a 
light into the darkness that we travel.

14:48.280 --> 14:51.980
Lord of Judgment, Sword Prince, 
Bearer of Scales, let there be light!

14:48.530 --> 14:53.590
O god of roaming wind, bring 
forth fortune in our travels!

14:48.990 --> 14:52.950
please protect us, the weak, 
with the powers of the earth.

14:52.650 --> 14:54.200
Let the darkness fall!

14:56.820 --> 14:58.410
Curse you, goblins!

14:59.450 --> 15:01.540
I did tell her.

15:02.350 --> 15:05.540
But the rest was up to her.

15:28.460 --> 15:29.780
<i>I...</i>

15:31.050 --> 15:33.450
<i>I want to support him.</i>

15:34.470 --> 15:37.070
<i>Someday, I'll be able to.</i>

15:44.730 --> 15:48.550
But I must say... Your plan was brilliant.

15:48.790 --> 15:51.760
Oh, you flatter me.

15:52.050 --> 15:56.350
Controlling the goblins with the fiery stone 
from heaven, having them kidnap the princess,

15:56.350 --> 15:59.250
then using her as a sacrifice 
to resurrect a dark god...

15:59.250 --> 16:03.800
Then having that dark god crossbreed 
with that thing from beyond the stars

16:03.800 --> 16:06.260
to create something even more terrifying...

16:06.260 --> 16:08.520
It can also impersonate the princess.

16:08.520 --> 16:13.280
We're going to take advantage of that, 
which will leave the king helpless.

16:13.850 --> 16:16.680
If any part of this succeeds, 
it's more than enough.

16:16.680 --> 16:18.380
Even if every part of it fails,

16:18.380 --> 16:21.790
as long as we spread rumors that 
the princess has been tainted,

16:21.790 --> 16:23.720
her engagement will fall through.

16:23.720 --> 16:27.430
The power of their bloodline will cease 
to be, the king's authority will wane,

16:27.430 --> 16:30.510
and the scale of power at the palace 
will tilt heavily to one side.

16:30.510 --> 16:33.960
There is no way a filthy adventurer 
like him has any right

16:33.960 --> 16:39.070
to run this kingdom just because 
he's related to the royal family.

16:39.070 --> 16:43.950
We will just be happy to gain 
more followers under your rule.

16:43.950 --> 16:48.240
Your wisdom will prove useful to me, as well.

16:49.330 --> 16:54.400
By the way, it's been a while since 
we've heard rumors of that nuisance.

16:55.440 --> 16:57.710
Do you believe that rumor?

16:57.710 --> 17:01.910
Rubbish. That's nothing more than 
a tale the commoners made up.

17:04.490 --> 17:05.670
What's going on?!

17:06.420 --> 17:08.630
Hey, guys. It's been a while.

17:09.070 --> 17:13.090
I'm sure you're missing me by now, too. Right?

17:16.490 --> 17:20.970
The Knight of Diamonds!

17:21.430 --> 17:25.070
Insolent cur! Do you know 
whose mansion this is?!

17:25.070 --> 17:27.120
Take off your helmet! I demand it!

17:27.120 --> 17:29.770
Oh? So you want to see my face?

17:29.770 --> 17:32.440
That's fine, but you'd better not regret it!

17:33.230 --> 17:33.970
Wha—

17:33.970 --> 17:34.840
It can't be!

17:34.840 --> 17:36.530
Guards! Guards!

17:36.530 --> 17:37.250
What's going on?!

17:37.250 --> 17:38.210
Is something wrong?!

17:44.480 --> 17:45.960
Honestly...

17:47.450 --> 17:50.290
Welp, I guess the cat's out of the bag.

17:50.290 --> 17:52.250
It doesn't matter, though.

17:52.250 --> 17:55.970
I'll strike you down in the name of heaven!

18:04.760 --> 18:08.190
So he didn't accept the reward?

18:08.190 --> 18:09.650
He didn't!

18:09.650 --> 18:11.060
Can you believe him?!

18:11.060 --> 18:15.520
Well, it's not that he didn't get it. 
We did actually receive it.

18:15.520 --> 18:17.400
Just the amount for goblin slaying!

18:17.400 --> 18:20.070
Well, you know how he is.

18:20.070 --> 18:23.330
Saving a noblewoman who was 
kidnapped during your travels...

18:23.990 --> 18:27.220
Yet goblin slaying is goblin slaying.

18:27.220 --> 18:28.540
Yes.

18:30.350 --> 18:33.470
But apparently, there was a lot 
going on in the capital, too.

18:33.470 --> 18:36.340
Evidently, another stronghold 
of heretics was taken down.

18:37.500 --> 18:42.730
Hm? What's wrong? If something's 
on your mind, tell me.

18:42.730 --> 18:45.220
I guess... becoming stronger...

18:45.770 --> 18:50.490
Or maybe I should say maturing... 
 It's so hard to do.

18:50.810 --> 18:52.400
I'm honestly about to lose hope.

18:52.400 --> 18:54.270
Well, of course it's hard!

18:54.270 --> 18:56.580
Even trees don't grow big in an instant!

18:56.580 --> 18:58.090
It'd be shocking if they did!

18:58.090 --> 19:01.970
Well, no good comes 
out of rushing anything.

19:01.970 --> 19:03.000
Right...

19:03.340 --> 19:06.820
Even if you were to gain experience by 
training and going on expeditions alone...

19:06.820 --> 19:08.960
That's not always reliable, either.

19:09.240 --> 19:14.200
By the way, I received some good news... 
Well, for you, at least.

19:14.200 --> 19:16.710
Good news?

19:16.710 --> 19:20.150
I heard that the princess has become 
a devout believer in the Earth Mother.

19:21.680 --> 19:23.010
That's...

19:25.240 --> 19:28.230
Oh! She's not joining a nunnery.

19:28.230 --> 19:32.350
But apparently, she met a cleric 
who serves the Earth Mother.

19:32.350 --> 19:33.470
Huh?

19:33.470 --> 19:38.620
"I don't know what the future holds, 
but I want to be like her," she said.

19:42.820 --> 19:44.320
H-Huh?

19:45.850 --> 19:49.040
Hey, that's great. Yeah, that's great news.

19:52.000 --> 19:52.710
Yes.

20:00.330 --> 20:01.990
<i>Nothing changed.</i>

20:03.400 --> 20:06.300
<i>We accept a quest, head to the location,</i>

20:06.300 --> 20:10.180
<i>slay goblins, save any prisoners, 
and go home.</i>

20:13.000 --> 20:14.750
<i>That is everything.</i>

20:14.750 --> 20:16.170
<i>That is my duty.</i>

20:16.630 --> 20:19.760
<i>This road doesn't end. It's neverending.</i>

20:21.620 --> 20:25.200
<i>I cannot walk the same path as those girls.</i>

20:28.970 --> 20:33.440
<i>I don't know what's right... 
but I know what I must do.</i>

20:34.430 --> 20:35.500
<i>That's all there is.</i>

21:09.130 --> 21:11.200
Oh, welcome home!

21:12.410 --> 21:14.510
I saw you from my window.

21:14.510 --> 21:18.380
It's dangerous to walk around 
in a daze when it's this dark.

21:18.880 --> 21:21.090
Yeah. I'm home.

21:21.090 --> 21:25.050
Yup! Dinner's already ready, so hurry up.

21:27.710 --> 21:29.470
<i>Nothing will change.</i>

21:29.980 --> 21:33.450
<i>I go on adventures and slay goblins.</i>

21:34.870 --> 21:36.410
<i>That's what I chose to do.</i>

21:37.540 --> 21:38.710
<i>And then...</i>

21:46.060 --> 21:48.490
<i>Nothing will change.</i>
